OMIM mapping confirmed by DO. [SN].</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>spondylocostal dysostosis</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0050569 -->

