        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mitochondrial metabolism disease that is characterized by hearing loss that begins early in life, problems with movement, impaired vision, and behavior problems, and has_material_basis_in mutations in the TIMM8A gene resulting in abnormal protein transport within the mitochondria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
