        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_628"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A combined T cell and B cell immunodeficiency that is a condition where there is co-occurrence of deficient cell-mediated immunity and benign thymoma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
