        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0060040"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pervasive developmental disorder that is a spectrum of psychological conditions. The disease has_symptom widespread abnormalities of social interactions and communication, has_symptom severely restricted interests and has_symptom highly repetitive behavior.</obo:IAO_0000115>
