        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0050687"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell type cancer that has_material_basis_in abnormally proliferating cells derives_from precursor cells called blast cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
