        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_2789"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A parasitic protozoa infectious disease that involves infection caused by parasitic protozoan of the genus Trypanosoma in animals and humans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
