        <obo:IAO_0000115>A viral infectious disease that results in infection in sheep and rarely humans, has_material_basis_in Louping ill virus, which is transmitted by sheep tick, Ixodes ricinus. The infection has symptom lethargy, has symptom muscle pains, has symptom fever, and has symptom focal neurological signs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
