        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_8501"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fundus dystrophy that is characterized by discrete uniform white dots over the entire fundus with greatest density in the midperiphery and no macular involvement.</obo:IAO_0000115>
