        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_1255"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A trichostrongyloidiasis that involves infection of the small intestine with Trichostrongylus colubriformis or Trichostrongylus axei, which results in abdominal pain, diarrhea, anorexia, headache, fatigue, anemia and eosinophilia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
