        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_14447"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A gonadal dysgenesis that is characterized by progressive loss of primordial cells on the developing glands of an embryo, leading to extremely hypoplastic and dysfuctioning gonads resulting in one differentiated gonad and either a streak gonad or streak testis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
