        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_3277"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A thymus cancer that derives_from epithelial cells. The tumor cells in a thymic carcinoma look very different from the normal cells of the thymus, grow more quickly, and have usually spread to other parts of the body when the cancer is found.</obo:IAO_0000115>
