        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_688"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An embryonal cancer that is a type of germ cell tumour that is located_in the ovaries or located_in the testes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
