        <obo:IAO_0000115>A viral infectious disease that results_in infection located_in skin, has_material_basis_in Orf virus, which is transmitted_by contact with infected or recently vaccinated animals, or transmitted_by fomites carrying the virus. The infection has_symptom lesions on the finger, hand, arm, face, and penis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
